# UC7-症状诊断用例图

flowchart LR
    actor "用户" as User
    rectangle "诊断模块" as Diag {
        card "输入症状" as C1
        card "发送请求" as C2
        card "Agent处理" as C3
        card "调用工具" as C4
        card "图谱查询" as C5
        card "返回结果" as C6
        card "渲染展示" as C7
    }

    User --> C1
    C1 --> C2
    C2 --> C3
    C3 --> C4
    C4 --> C5
    C5 --> C6
    C6 --> C7